windows: Han layout follows a Han language, the app's first

DirectWrite chose Han glyphs and fallback fonts by the user's locale
alone. Under a locale that is not Han, the user's first Han language
now leads the layout, and an app may name its own with
set_text_language (Ely R4.13).

